  "question": {
    "text": "If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><msqrt><mi>sec</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo></math> constant, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></math> is equal to ______."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><msqrt><mi>sec</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>Now solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><msqrt><mi>sec</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msqrt><mi>sec</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msqrt><mi>sec</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msqrt><mi>sec</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>|</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>|</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>&#183;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>&#183;</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>Now on comparing with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><msqrt><mi>sec</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>We get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>"
  }
